    % Avoid obstacle
    move(robot, 'backward', 0.5);
    turn(robot, 'left', 90);
else
    % Move forward
    move(robot, 'forward', 0.5);
end
```
3. Remote Control: Ground robots can be remotely controlled using a computer or a mobile device. This allows operators to control the robot from a safe distance. Here is an example code for remote control in MATLAB:
```matlab
robot = robotics.RoboticsSystem('Name', 'RemoteControlledRobot');
% Connect to robot
