4. Finally, remove the extra space at the end of the StringBuilder object and return the reversed sentence as a String.
Here's the Java code that implements these steps:
```
public static String reverseSentence(String sentence) {
    String[] words = sentence.split("[\\s\\p{Punct}]+");
    StringBuilder reversed = new StringBuilder();
    for (int i = words.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        reversed.append(words[i]).append(" ");
    }
    reversed.deleteCharAt(reversed.length() - 1);
    return reversed.toString();
}
