You can count the number of times a specific word appears in a given passage using Swift by first splitting the passage into an array of words and then iterating through the array to count the occurrences of the specific word. Here's an example code snippet:
```
let passage = "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Proin lacinia nibh felis, quis dignissim quam interdum ut."
let wordToCount = "quis"
// Split the passage into an array of words
let words = passage.components(separatedBy: " ")
// Count the occurrences of the specific word
var count = 0
for word in words {
    if word.lowercased() == wordToCount.lowercased() {
        count += 1
    }
}
print("The word '\(wordToCount)' appears \(count) times in the passage.")
```
